        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of printed silk gauze, England, ca. 1830-1860."@en , "Dress fabric of printed silk gauze woven with silk stripes in the warp and the weft and grouped together ten at a time. A bunch of flowers in blue, red, mauve and green is printed at intervals. There is a selvedge on the left-hand side."@en ;
